{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kart Racing World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A clean and realistic kart racing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kart Racing World</i> brings the thrill of professional kart racing with realistic handling and smooth gameplay. Feel the kart racing to your screen with a sim-style experience tailored for enthusiasts. Take control of finely-tuned karts across beautifully crafted tracks, each set in dynamic weather conditions\u2014from sunny circuits to stormy showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/e07f18085c39cb38437b9bd624957b10.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/e07f18085c39cb38437b9bd624957b10.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/e07f18085c39cb38437b9bd624957b10.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kart Racing World</i> offers a realistic kart racing designed for sim-racing fans. Choose your kart, set race conditions, and compete across laps in beautiful and varied environments. From light drizzles to full-blown storms, every weather type affects the race. Customize AI difficulty and the number of opponents to suit your style. Clean, challenging, and immersive karting <strong>racing experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/1ead3bd7642c7947cefbeb868eca91dc.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/1ead3bd7642c7947cefbeb868eca91dc.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/1ead3bd7642c7947cefbeb868eca91dc.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the Track. Master Every Turn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel in <i>Kart Racing World</i>, a simulation-style kart racer that focuses on precision, control, and competition. Race in stunning tracks with changing weather\u2014from sunny days to stormy skies. Adjust AI difficulty, choose how many drivers you face, and take on intense lap-based races. Whether you're racing for practice or pushing limits, this game delivers pure karting thrills in a professional, polished package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/bd49654a9cdfe0eca3633b04b8ecd5a3.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/bd49654a9cdfe0eca3633b04b8ecd5a3.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/bd49654a9cdfe0eca3633b04b8ecd5a3.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Karts</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of realistic karts and drive kart with different handling and feel the performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driver Customization</strong> \u2013 Change how your racer looks to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather</strong> \u2013 Race through clear skies, heavy rain, cloudy days, and even stormy conditions that challenge your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable AI</strong> \u2013 Adjust the number of AI drivers and their difficulty (Easy, Medium, Hard) to suit your racing style. You can Set the number of AI opponents as per your racing skills on smooth and circuit race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lap-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Tackle competitive lap races that test precision, consistency, and control. It\u2019s a Pure racing with clean lap-focused gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sim-Style Flexible Controls</strong> \u2013 Play with a keyboard or take it to the next level with a Logitech steering wheel. Enjoy a refined racing system ideal for players who want karts race on flexible racing tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/5682114548752ad9c76d631fdcba8366.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/5682114548752ad9c76d631fdcba8366.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/5682114548752ad9c76d631fdcba8366.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >refine your racing skills to enjoy Karts driving experience, <i>Kart Racing World</i> delivers a grounded and immersive karting simulation\u2014perfect for skilled racers and sim fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/c404846bc0a01b137826978b57753d4e.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/c404846bc0a01b137826978b57753d4e.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/c404846bc0a01b137826978b57753d4e.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready to hit the track of\u00a0<strong>Kart Racing World\u00a0</strong>and prove you're the fastest on four wheels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/41209e868442a89e0adf6b3e0e4c70d3.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/41209e868442a89e0adf6b3e0e4c70d3.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/41209e868442a89e0adf6b3e0e4c70d3.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905580?t=1758440795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/880d062d34b150053d94c54416950dd18949c633/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758440795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/bc4942d643fe4a372127509ee4400b292375d3b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758440795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/bc4942d643fe4a372127509ee4400b292375d3b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758440795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kart Racing World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A clean and realistic kart racing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kart Racing World</i> brings the thrill of professional kart racing with realistic handling and smooth gameplay. Feel the kart racing to your screen with a sim-style experience tailored for enthusiasts. Take control of finely-tuned karts across beautifully crafted tracks, each set in dynamic weather conditions\u2014from sunny circuits to stormy showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/e07f18085c39cb38437b9bd624957b10.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/e07f18085c39cb38437b9bd624957b10.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/e07f18085c39cb38437b9bd624957b10.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kart Racing World</i> offers a realistic kart racing designed for sim-racing fans. Choose your kart, set race conditions, and compete across laps in beautiful and varied environments. From light drizzles to full-blown storms, every weather type affects the race. Customize AI difficulty and the number of opponents to suit your style. Clean, challenging, and immersive karting <strong>racing experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/1ead3bd7642c7947cefbeb868eca91dc.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/1ead3bd7642c794