 that challenge your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable AI</strong> \u2013 Adjust the number of AI drivers and their difficulty (Easy, Medium, Hard) to suit your racing style. You can Set the number of AI opponents as per your racing skills on smooth and circuit race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lap-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Tackle competitive lap races that test precision, consistency, and control. It\u2019s a Pure racing with clean lap-focused gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sim-Style Flexible Controls</strong> \u2013 Play with a keyboard or take it to the next level with a Logitech steering wheel. Enjoy a refined racing system ideal for players who want karts race on flexible racing tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/5682114548752ad9c76d631fdcba8366.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/5682114548752ad9c76d631fdcba8366.webm?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/5682114548752ad9c76d631fdcba8366.mp4?t=1758440795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >refine your racing skills to enjoy Karts driving experience, <i>Kart Racing World</i> delivers a grounded and immersive karting simulation\u2014perfect for skilled racers and sim fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905580/extras/c404846bc0a01b137826978b57753d4e.poster.avif?t=1758440795\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam